sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client / KServe Router
    participant API as vLLM OpenAI API Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Worker as HPUWorker<br/>In-process
    participant Runner as HPUModelRunner<br/>Graph Compilation
    participant HPU as Intel Gaudi HPU<br/>PCIe / Habana Interconnect
    participant Storage as Model Storage<br/>S3 / PVC / HuggingFace<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 1: Model Weight Loading (startup)
    API->>Worker: Initialize model loading
    Worker->>Storage: Download model weights<br/>HTTPS / filesystem<br/>TLS 1.2+ / IAM Token
    Storage-->>Worker: Model artifacts
    Worker->>HPU: Transfer weights to device memory<br/>PCIe
    HPU-->>Worker: Weights loaded

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 2: Model Inference Request
    Client->>API: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP (TLS terminated at ingress)
    API->>Worker: Schedule inference
    Worker->>Runner: Execute forward pass
    Runner->>HPU: Run compiled graph<br/>Bucketed execution
    HPU-->>Runner: Inference result
    Runner-->>Worker: Output tokens
    Worker-->>API: Generated text
    API-->>Client: JSON Response<br/>(streaming or batch)

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 3: Distributed Inference (Multi-HPU)
    participant WorkerN as HPUWorker rank N<br/>HCCL / NIXL
    Worker->>WorkerN: Distribute computation<br/>HCCL / NIXL<br/>No encryption (intra-node)
    WorkerN->>HPU: Execute on rank N device
    HPU-->>WorkerN: Partial result
    WorkerN-->>Worker: Aggregated output
